    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has established a new [deployment mandate](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for the Meridian project, requiring a signed release manifest for all software shipments. This decision is framed as a [corrective measure](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) following the unauthorized entry of unsigned artifacts into staging during the previous quarter. The scope of this requirement [extends to both staging and production](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4), with Fairweather explicitly [identifying himself as the owner](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) of the policy. The communication style is highly structured, oscillating between formal, authoritative directives and plain-spoken justifications for the change.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The justification for the gate rests on a specific past failure, contrasting with the abstract, forward-looking nature of the policy itself." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "The voice moves from a position of decisive authority to one of explanatory grounding." ; narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "He shifts between formal, administrative language and a direct, plain-spoken register when addressing the rationale." ; narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "style" ; narr:reading "The profile is marked by the use of antithesis to draw sharp lines between past error and current requirement." ; narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
